    <artifactId>homing-ui-icons</artifactId>
    <description>
        Icons: a mark that means something - check, close, detach, rotate -
        and never says what it looks like. An Icon word of the design
        vocabulary, worn on a mark element through the Glyph target; the
        design draws the picture. One element component, Icon, and one
        generated table of the words. RFC 0066 Episode 3, appendix Context
        Menus, section on icons.
    </description>

    <properties>
